<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπωρ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπώρα</span> II) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gather
				fruit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. ὀπώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					845a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦκα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				844e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ συκῆς ὠπώριζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					6.61
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>eat fruits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				612a30
			</span></i> ; <i>gather in the fruits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				9
			</span></i> :—so in 
				Med.
			, <i>gather in one's fruits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Hist.
				89
			</span></i> : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς τὰν ὥραν αὐτῶν βολλομένοις
					ὀπωρίξασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dius
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.21.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>gather fruit off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπωριεῦντες</span> (
				Ion.
			
			fut. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦντες</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τοὺς φοίνικας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.172
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				182
			</span></i>.</div>
